silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_yoneda_hom_leg_2 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "GlueKleisliLegUMediatingExample" .
silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_14_kleisli_enrichment_pipeline_sections_05_glue_as_kleisli_arrow_yoneda_hom_leg_2 silm:hasExample "In 'GlueKleisliLegUMediating', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, JoC §11.3: For every compatible cocone (C, (mu_j)), there is a unique mediating arrow u: colim D -> C such that mu_j = u o lambda_j for all j. Here u: Mittens -> VetCarePlan77 satisfies mu_j = u o lambda_j for all ten legs j." .
